itemtype="https://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement"><ul id="menu-menu-main" class="menu fl-menu-horizontal"><li id="menu-item-47" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-home menu-item-47"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/">Home</a></li><li id="menu-item-635" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-635"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/reviews/">Reviews</a></li><li id="menu-item-637" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page current-menu-item page_item page-item-542 current_page_item menu-item-637"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/qualifications/" aria-current="page">Qualifications</a></li><li id="menu-item-624" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type_archive menu-item-object-service menu-item-has-children menu-item-624"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/services/">Services</a><ul class="sub-menu"><li id="menu-item-629" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-629"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/services/power-and-lighting-installation/">Power And Lighting Installation</a></li><li id="menu-item-631" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-631"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/services/smartvent-installation-auckland/">SmartVent Installation Auckland</a></li><li id="menu-item-628" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-628"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/services/led-lighting-upgrades/">LED Lighting Upgrades</a></li><li id="menu-item-632" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-632"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/services/switchboard-upgrades/">Switchboard Upgrades</a></li><li id="menu-item-627" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-627"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/services/electrical-home-assessments/">Electrical Home Assessments</a></li><li id="menu-item-625" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-625"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/services/electrical-fault-diagnosis/">Electrical Fault Diagnosis</a></li><li id="menu-item-630" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-630"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/services/safety-compliance-checks/">Safety Compliance Checks</a></li><li id="menu-item-626" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-626"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/services/earthing-checks/">Earthing Checks</a></li><li id="menu-item-633" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-service menu-item-633"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/services/underground-cable-checks/">Underground Cable Checks</a></li></ul></li><li id="menu-item-636" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-636"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/about/">About</a></li><li id="menu-item-656" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type_archive menu-item-object-article menu-item-656"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/articles/">Articles</a></li><li id="menu-item-634" class="menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-634"><a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/contact/">Contact</a></li></ul></nav></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fl-col-group"><div class="fl-col"><div class="fl-col-content"><div class="fl-module fl-module-menu"><div class="fl-module-content"><div class="fl-menu"><nav aria-label="Menu"
itemscope="itemscope"
itemtype="https://schema.org/SiteNavigationElement"><ul id="menu-menu-bottom" class="menu fl-menu-horizontal"><li id="menu-item-639" class="menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-639"><a href="mailto:josh@neonelectrical.com">josh@neonelectrical.com</a></li></ul></nav></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fl-overlay" hidden></div></header><main role="main" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/WebPage"><article id="post-542" class="post-542 page type-page status-publish hentry" itemprop="mainEntity"><header class="hero"><div class="fl-row fl-row-full-width"><div class="fl-row-content-wrap"><div class="fl-row-content fl-row-fixed-width"><div class="fl-col-group"><div class="fl-col"><div class="fl-col-content"><h5 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text" itemprop="alternativeHeadline">
[ My Qualifications ]</h5><h1 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text" itemprop="headline">
Expertise &amp; experience</h1></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><div class="content clearfix"><div class="fl-builder-content fl-builder-content-542 fl-builder-content-primary fl-builder-global-templates-locked" data-post-id="542"><div class="fl-row fl-row-fixed-width fl-row-bg-none fl-node-pd3g24jk0mtq fl-row-default-height fl-row-align-center" data-node="pd3g24jk0mtq"><div class="fl-row-content-wrap"><div class="fl-row-content fl-row-fixed-width fl-node-content"><div class="fl-col-group fl-node-xzpab9u2sr6o" data-node="xzpab9u2sr6o"><div class="fl-col fl-node-w91028txbpln fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="w91028txbpln"><div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><h2  class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text fl-node-7k5en81xybfc" data-node="7k5en81xybfc" aria-label="Heading">
Master Electrician</h2></div></div><div class="fl-col fl-node-h6uy7z2vdmtx fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="h6uy7z2vdmtx"><div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><div  class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text fl-node-xz5uvnl9t4pc" data-node="xz5uvnl9t4pc" aria-label="Text Editor"><p>Being a registered member of Master Electricians New Zealand means my work meets the highest industry standards, and every residential job I complete is backed by a <a href="https://www.masterelectricians.org.nz/for-consumers/workmanship-guarantee/" target="_blank" rel="noopener nofollow">$20,000 Workmanship Guarantee</a>. This guarantee ensures that if any issues arise within 12 months, they will be investigated and rectified at no extra cost—so you can trust that your electrical work is done right, every time.</p></div><div class="fl-module fl-module-accordion fl-node-uksvqd69j0xi" data-node="uksvqd69j0xi" aria-label="Accordion"><div class="fl-module-content fl-node-content"><div class="fl-accordion fl-accordion-small fl-accordion-collapse"><div class="fl-accordion-item"><div id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-button-0" aria-controls="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-content-0" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" class="fl-accordion-button"><a class="fl-accordion-button-label" role="none">What is the $20,000 Workmanship Guarantee?</a><a id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-icon-0" class="fl-accordion-button-icon fl-accordion-button-icon-right" role="none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fl-accordion-button-icon fas fa-plus" data-label-icon="fas fa-plus" data-active-icon="fas fa-minus"><span class="sr-only">Expand</span></i></a></div><div id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-content-0" class="fl-accordion-content fl-clearfix" role="region" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-button-0"><p>When you hire a Master Electrician, your residential electrical work is automatically covered by a $20,000 Workmanship Guarantee. This means that if any workmanship-related issues arise within 12 months of completion, they can be investigated and rectified at no extra cost. It’s an added layer of security to ensure your job is done right the first time.</p></div></div><div class="fl-accordion-item"><div id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-button-1" aria-controls="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-content-1" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" class="fl-accordion-button"><a class="fl-accordion-button-label" role="none">What does the guarantee cover?</a><a id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-icon-1" class="fl-accordion-button-icon fl-accordion-button-icon-right" role="none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fl-accordion-button-icon fas fa-plus" data-label-icon="fas fa-plus" data-active-icon="fas fa-minus"><span class="sr-only">Expand</span></i></a></div><div id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-content-1" class="fl-accordion-content fl-clearfix" role="region" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-button-1"><p>The guarantee covers:</p><ul><li>Work done by the original contractor.</li><li>Labour costs and replacement materials (up to $20,000 including GST).</li><li>Residential electrical work only.</li><li>Any necessary remediation, completed by either the original contractor or another Master Electrician, as determined by Master Electricians New Zealand.</li></ul></div></div><div class="fl-accordion-item"><div id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-button-2" aria-controls="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-content-2" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" class="fl-accordion-button"><a class="fl-accordion-button-label" role="none">How do I make a claim under the Workmanship Guarantee?</a><a id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-icon-2" class="fl-accordion-button-icon fl-accordion-button-icon-right" role="none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fl-accordion-button-icon fas fa-plus" data-label-icon="fas fa-plus" data-active-icon="fas fa-minus"><span class="sr-only">Expand</span></i></a></div><div id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-content-2" class="fl-accordion-content fl-clearfix" role="region" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-button-2"><p>If you ever have concerns about the workmanship of a job, follow these steps:</p><ul><li>Contact me first – I stand by my work and will do everything I can to resolve the issue.</li><li>If needed, escalate to Master Electricians – If we’re unable to reach a resolution, you can submit a claim to Master Electricians New Zealand with your invoice details.</li><li>Investigation and resolution – The Master Electricians Guarantee Committee will review your case and arrange for the necessary work to be completed, up to the $20,000 guarantee limit.</li></ul></div></div><div class="fl-accordion-item"><div id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-button-3" aria-controls="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-content-3" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" class="fl-accordion-button"><a class="fl-accordion-button-label" role="none">Why should I choose a Master Electrician over another electrician?</a><a id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-icon-3" class="fl-accordion-button-icon fl-accordion-button-icon-right" role="none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fl-accordion-button-icon fas fa-plus" data-label-icon="fas fa-plus" data-active-icon="fas fa-minus"><span class="sr-only">Expand</span></i></a></div><div id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-content-3" class="fl-accordion-content fl-clearfix" role="region" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-button-3"><p>Master Electricians are held to higher standards than regular electricians. When you hire me, you’re not just getting an electrician—you’re getting:</p><ul><li>Quality Assurance Certification – I’ve been assessed to ensure my work meets industry-leading standards.</li><li>Guaranteed Workmanship – Your electrical work is covered by the exclusive $20,000 Master Electricians Guarantee.</li><li>Safety &amp; Compliance – I follow strict Workplace Health &amp; Safety regulations and ensure all work meets New Zealand’s electrical codes.</li></ul></div></div><div class="fl-accordion-item"><div id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-button-4" aria-controls="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-content-4" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" class="fl-accordion-button"><a class="fl-accordion-button-label" role="none">Can you provide compliance certificates for your work?</a><a id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-icon-4" class="fl-accordion-button-icon fl-accordion-button-icon-right" role="none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fl-accordion-button-icon fas fa-plus" data-label-icon="fas fa-plus" data-active-icon="fas fa-minus"><span class="sr-only">Expand</span></i></a></div><div id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-content-4" class="fl-accordion-content fl-clearfix" role="region" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-button-4"><p>Yes! As a licensed Master Electrician, I can issue Codes of Compliance Certificates and Electrical Safety Certificates, proving that my work has been tested and meets all relevant safety and regulatory standards.</p></div></div><div class="fl-accordion-item"><div id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-button-5" aria-controls="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-content-5" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" class="fl-accordion-button"><a class="fl-accordion-button-label" role="none">How do you ensure safety during electrical work?</a><a id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-icon-5" class="fl-accordion-button-icon fl-accordion-button-icon-right" role="none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fl-accordion-button-icon fas fa-plus" data-label-icon="fas fa-plus" data-active-icon="fas fa-minus"><span class="sr-only">Expand</span></i></a></div><div id="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-content-5" class="fl-accordion-content fl-clearfix" role="region" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="fl-accordion-uksvqd69j0xi-button-5"><p>Safety is my top priority. As a Master Electrician, I follow strict Workplace Health & Safety guidelines to keep you, your home, and my team safe. I stay up to date with the latest industry regulations and use only approved materials and methods to ensure the highest safety standards.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fl-module fl-module-button fl-node-4bp7zj0gkn5l fl-button-wrap fl-button-width-auto fl-button-left" data-node="4bp7zj0gkn5l" aria-label="Button"><a href="https://www.masterelectricians.org.nz/for-consumers/workmanship-guarantee/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="fl-button"><span class="fl-button-text">$20,000 Workmanship Guarantee</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div id="insurance" class="fl-row fl-row-fixed-width fl-row-bg-none fl-node-4bqosjvfdaik fl-row-default-height fl-row-align-center" data-node="4bqosjvfdaik"><div class="fl-row-content-wrap"><div class="fl-row-content fl-row-fixed-width fl-node-content"><div class="fl-col-group fl-node-yqhp1j2f75o3" data-node="yqhp1j2f75o3"><div class="fl-col fl-node-nrhw90zq6kmc fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="nrhw90zq6kmc"><div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><h2  class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text fl-node-xnkdwhv9come" data-node="xnkdwhv9come" aria-label="Heading">
Public liability insurance</h2></div></div><div class="fl-col fl-node-0rnw9qz1aj62 fl-col-bg-color fl-col-small" data-node="0rnw9qz1aj62"><div class="fl-col-content fl-node-content"><div  class="fl-module fl-module-rich-text fl-rich-text fl-node-j8wdn9k21vbx" data-node="j8wdn9k21vbx" aria-label="Text Editor"><p>I take your safety and security seriously. That’s why Neon Electrical is backed by a $5 million Public Liability Insurance policy, ensuring that you’re fully protected in the unlikely event of accidental damage or issues arising from electrical work. This coverage, underwritten by AIG Insurance New Zealand Limited, provides peace of mind for both residential and commercial clients.</p></div><div class="fl-module fl-module-accordion fl-node-jb8cp4zoi9sh" data-node="jb8cp4zoi9sh" aria-label="Accordion"><div class="fl-module-content fl-node-content"><div class="fl-accordion fl-accordion-small fl-accordion-collapse"><div class="fl-accordion-item"><div id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-button-0" aria-controls="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-content-0" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" class="fl-accordion-button"><a class="fl-accordion-button-label" role="none">What is Public Liability Insurance, and why does it matter?</a><a id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-icon-0" class="fl-accordion-button-icon fl-accordion-button-icon-right" role="none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fl-accordion-button-icon fas fa-plus" data-label-icon="fas fa-plus" data-active-icon="fas fa-minus"><span class="sr-only">Expand</span></i></a></div><div id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-content-0" class="fl-accordion-content fl-clearfix" role="region" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-button-0"><p>Public Liability Insurance protects you and your property in the unlikely event of accidental damage or issues caused during electrical work. It ensures that if something unexpected happens, you won’t be left out of pocket</p></div></div><div class="fl-accordion-item"><div id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-button-1" aria-controls="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-content-1" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" class="fl-accordion-button"><a class="fl-accordion-button-label" role="none">How much coverage does Neon Electrical have?</a><a id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-icon-1" class="fl-accordion-button-icon fl-accordion-button-icon-right" role="none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fl-accordion-button-icon fas fa-plus" data-label-icon="fas fa-plus" data-active-icon="fas fa-minus"><span class="sr-only">Expand</span></i></a></div><div id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-content-1" class="fl-accordion-content fl-clearfix" role="region" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-button-1"><p>I’m covered by a $5 million Public Liability Insurance policy, underwritten by AIG Insurance New Zealand Limited. This provides comprehensive protection for my clients.</p></div></div><div class="fl-accordion-item"><div id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-button-2" aria-controls="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-content-2" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" class="fl-accordion-button"><a class="fl-accordion-button-label" role="none"> Does this insurance cover both residential and commercial work?</a><a id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-icon-2" class="fl-accordion-button-icon fl-accordion-button-icon-right" role="none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fl-accordion-button-icon fas fa-plus" data-label-icon="fas fa-plus" data-active-icon="fas fa-minus"><span class="sr-only">Expand</span></i></a></div><div id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-content-2" class="fl-accordion-content fl-clearfix" role="region" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-button-2"><p>Yes! My public liability coverage applies to all electrical work, whether in your home, business, or commercial space.</p></div></div><div class="fl-accordion-item"><div id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-button-3" aria-controls="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-content-3" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" class="fl-accordion-button"><a class="fl-accordion-button-label" role="none">What does Public Liability Insurance cover?</a><a id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-icon-3" class="fl-accordion-button-icon fl-accordion-button-icon-right" role="none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fl-accordion-button-icon fas fa-plus" data-label-icon="fas fa-plus" data-active-icon="fas fa-minus"><span class="sr-only">Expand</span></i></a></div><div id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-content-3" class="fl-accordion-content fl-clearfix" role="region" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-button-3"><p>This insurance covers:</p><ul><li>Accidental damage to your property caused by electrical work.</li><li>Any third-party injuries that may occur on-site.</li><li>Legal and financial protection in case of unexpected incidents.</li></ul></div></div><div class="fl-accordion-item"><div id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-button-4" aria-controls="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-content-4" aria-expanded="false" role="button" tabindex="0" class="fl-accordion-button"><a class="fl-accordion-button-label" role="none">How does this benefit me as a customer?</a><a id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-icon-4" class="fl-accordion-button-icon fl-accordion-button-icon-right" role="none" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fl-accordion-button-icon fas fa-plus" data-label-icon="fas fa-plus" data-active-icon="fas fa-minus"><span class="sr-only">Expand</span></i></a></div><div id="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-content-4" class="fl-accordion-content fl-clearfix" role="region" aria-hidden="true" aria-labelledby="fl-accordion-jb8cp4zoi9sh-button-4"><p>Hiring a fully insured electrician means you get peace of mind. You can trust that I follow strict safety protocols and that you’re financially protected in the rare event that something goes wrong.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="fl-module fl-module-button fl-node-g1743ypef0ij fl-button-wrap fl-button-width-auto fl-button-left" data-node="g1743ypef0ij" aria-label="Button"><a href="/wp-content/uploads/pdf/public-liability-certificate.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="fl-button"><span class="fl-button-text">My public liability certificate</span></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></article></main><footer role="contentinfo" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/WPFooter" class="navigation"><div class="fl-row fl-row-full-width"><div class="fl-row-content-wrap"><div class="fl-row-content fl-row-fixed-width"><div class="fl-col-group"><div class="fl-col"><div class="fl-col-content"><h2 class="fl-module fl-module-heading fl-heading fl-heading-text">Ready to get started on your next project?</h2></div></div><div class="fl-col"><div class="fl-col-content"><div class="fl-module fl-module-photo fl-photo" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/Organization"><div class="fl-photo-content">
<a href="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/" aria-label="Neon Electrical homepage" itemprop="url">
<img data-lazyloaded="1" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODdhAQABAPAAAMPDwwAAACwAAAAAAQABAAACAkQBADs=" data-src="https://www.neonelectrical.co.nz/wp-content/uploads/branding/logo.svg"
decoding="async"
